{"v":4,"catch":"警告，外星人接近。","desc":"“CONTRA”是KONAMI於1987年發布的動作遊戲。\n最強大的戰士CONTRA，“Bill”和“Lance”將以他們的熱情“鬥魂”（戰鬥精神）和天生的游擊戰術來挑戰破壞外星人入侵地球的基地。\n在這項工作中，包括了CONTRA的日語版和海外版。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2020-09-03","genres":["動作","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f5f00b8e23b55e5e794a7c1ac0d294023e3897db2232dbaf6b7e4afec13e8c18.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a9775c0ddc5b2283a801ec233ddc67b163d26ab9dc69a32fe87501d778f2bce4.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/5c5ff1836856bb7815fea5239534bdca2423901acd4bae3014a3db778bbab31d.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/83b3ba8a0baf7c122eee9ae8956c973017ef3e5449f2c3fc14eba9faebd72106.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b86e192b3b0ace1b056dc9aec059656d9087229c152fd5eb8b7319d48018d4e4.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f1006fc07616bd84e28b5e605b44720ec7dc6097c22bf7a5957a63f02f7b270b.jpg"],"titleId":"01007f4012b84000","dlc":[]}